===Etymology 1===
{{ja-kanjitab|yomi=k|いろ}}
{{wp|ja:}}

{{IPAfont|⟨iro<sub>2</sub>⟩}} → *{{IPAfont|/irə/}} → {{IPAfont|/iro/}}

From {{inh-lite|ja|ojp|-|sort=いろ}}.

First attested in the ''{{w|Nihon Shoki}}'' with the meaning of {{m-lite|en|color}}.<ref name="KDJ2">{{R:Nihon Kokugo Daijiten 2}}</ref> Senses referring to a person's [[emotion]]s also appear quite early on. The {{m-lite|en|romance}} or {{m-lite|en|sex}} senses appear from the 900s, apparently an influence from {{cog-lite|zh|-}} usage,<ref name="KDJ2"/> and roughly comparable to the [[euphemistic]] usage of {{cog-lite|en|colorful}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{ja-pron|いろ|acc=2|acc_ref=DJR,NHK|audio=Ja-iro-colour.ogg}}
{{ja-accent-dialectal|region=Keihan|k|い|ろ|íꜜrò}}

====Noun====
{{ja-noun|いろ}}

# {{defdate|from 720}} [[color]]
#: {{ja-usex|目の'''色'''が違う猫|め の '''いろ''' が ちがう ねこ|a cat that has eyes of different '''color'''}}
# {{defdate|from 797}} {{lb|ja|figurative}} the metaphorical color or [[mood]]
## one's [[facial]] [[coloring]] or [[expression]]
## the [[shape]] of one's [[face]] or [[appearance]]; more specifically, beautiful [[looks]] or a beautiful [[figure]]
## [[lively]] [[elegance]], [[enjoyable]] or [[interesting]] [[charm]]
## apparent [[thoughtfulness]], [[warmheartedness]]
## the [[feeling]] or [[mood]] of a thing
## the [[tenor]] or [[timber]] of a [[voice]] or [[sound]]
## in [[Noh]], a section that is [[chant]]ed at a medium pace; alternately, a [[decorative]] [[poetic]] section
## in {{m-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|浄瑠璃||tr=jōruri|puppet show narrative}}, a [[lively]] section that is neither strictly [[dialog]] nor [[narration]], but has many elements of dialog
## when playing the [[koto]], pushing on a string with the fingers of the left hand to change the [[pitch]] of a [[note]], or for [[vibrato]]
# {{defdate|from early 900s}} something related to [[romantic]] or [[sexual]] [[love]], particularly between genders
## the [[emotion]]s or [[circumstance]]s of [[attraction]] between [[gender]]s
## [[extramarital]] [[relation]]s, an [[affair]]
## an [[extramarital]] [[lover]]
## a [[prostitute]]
## a [[red-light district]]
# {{defdate|from late 900s}} the [[type]] or [[kind]] of something
# {{lb|ja|sort=いろ|informal|slang}} various specific kinds of [[color]]:
## {{lb|ja|sort=いろ|informal|slang|woman's speech}} [[lipstick]] or [[rouge]]
## {{lb|ja|sort=いろ|informal|slang}} [[soy sauce]]
## {{lb|ja|sort=いろ|informal|slang}} [[paint]]

