[[File:Grass.jpg|thumb|250px|{{lang|ja|芝}}: common [[grass]], especially as found in [[lawn]]s.]]
{{ja-kanjitab|yomi=kun|しば}}
From {{inh|ja|ojp|-|sort=しば}}. One of the oldest attested words in the Japanese language, used in the ''[[w:Man'yōshū|Man'yōshū]]'' and ''[[w:Nihon_Shoki|Nihon Shoki]]''.

